        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-68" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; tab-size: 4; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250); border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.45; overflow: auto; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;team_chat&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;RoundRobinGroupChat&lt;/span&gt;(&#xa;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;participants&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;[&#xa;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;product_manager&lt;/span&gt;,&#xa;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;engineer&lt;/span&gt;,&#xa;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;code_reviewer&lt;/span&gt;,&#xa;        &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;user_proxy&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;    ],&#xa;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;termination_condition&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;TextMentionTermination&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;TERMINATE&quot;&lt;/span&gt;),&#xa;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;max_turns&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;20&lt;/span&gt;,&#xa;)&lt;/pre&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="260" width="570" x="1366" y="3010" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-69" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;pre style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &amp;quot;Monaspace Neon&amp;quot;, ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, &amp;quot;SF Mono&amp;quot;, Menlo, Consolas, &amp;quot;Liberation Mono&amp;quot;, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; tab-size: 4; overflow-wrap: normal; padding: 16px; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); background-color: rgb(246, 248, 250); border-radius: 6px; line-height: 1.45; overflow: auto; word-break: normal; min-height: 52px; text-align: start;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-k&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(207, 34, 46);&quot;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-en&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(102, 57, 186);&quot;&gt;create_product_manager&lt;/span&gt;(&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;model_client&lt;/span&gt;):&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;创建产品经理智能体&quot;&quot;&quot;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;    &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box;&quot;&gt;system_message&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-c1&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(5, 80, 174);&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&quot;&quot;&quot;你是一位经验丰富的产品经理，专门负责软件产品的需求分析和项目规划。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;你的核心职责包括：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;1. **需求分析**：深入理解用户需求，识别核心功能和边界条件&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;2. **技术规划**：基于需求制定清晰的技术实现路径&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;3. **风险评估**：识别潜在的技术风险和用户体验问题&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;pl-s&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(10, 48, 105);&quot;&gt;4. **协调沟通**：与工程师和其他团队成员进行有效沟通&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;......&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="280" width="720" x="2160" y="2693" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-70" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;而 LangGraph 将每一步操作（如调用LLM、执行工具）定义为图中的一个&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;节点 (Node)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;，并用&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;边 (Edge)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt; 来定义节点之间的跳转逻辑。这种设计天然支持&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;循环 (Cycles)&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="604" x="1520" y="1540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-73" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;将智能体的执行流程建模为&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;图 (Graph)&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="300" x="1156" y="1540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-74" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;另一种技术路径：&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;工程化优先的多智能体平台&lt;/strong&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="360" x="650" y="3940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-75" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;" value="&#xa;&lt;h2 tabindex=&quot;-1&quot; class=&quot;heading-element&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-size: 1.5em; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25; border-bottom: 0.553097px solid rgba(209, 217, 224, 0.7); padding-bottom: 0.3em; color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;6.3 框架二：AgentScope&lt;/h2&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="300" x="264" y="3940" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-76" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; float: none; display: inline !important;&quot;&gt;调试过程可能非常棘手。与传统程序不同，我们得到的不是清晰的错误堆栈，而是一长串的对话历史&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="60" width="360" x="1330" y="3820" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="jgeiD4aFYxCPjX-TWa7s-77" parent="1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=16;" value="&#xa;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(31, 35, 40); font-family: &amp;quot;Mona Sans VF&amp;quot;, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &amp;quot;Segoe UI&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans Backtick Fix&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Noto Sans&amp;quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &amp;quot;Apple Color Emoji&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Segoe UI Emoji&amp;quot;; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;&quot;&gt;对话本质上具有不确定性。智能体可能会产生偏离预期的回复&lt;/span&gt;&#xa;&#xa;" vertex="1">
